Face model assets in this folder come from @vladmandic/human 3.3.6
(https://github.com/vladmandic/human), MIT-licensed code.

Included models:
- blazeface (MediaPipe BlazeFace face detector)
- facemesh (MediaPipe FaceMesh)
- faceres (HSE FaceRes face description / embedding)

Each model keeps the license of its original source; see
https://github.com/vladmandic/human/wiki/Models for credits.

These files are served locally so face capture never leaves the browser.
